ation;* > > *(c) agrees that no amount of money is worth supporting corruption, bullying, sexism and thuggery; and* > > *(d) calls on the Leader of The Australian Greens to clarify the full extent of the party's relationship with the CFMEU and confirm that the party will not accept any donations from the CFMEU while it is under administration.*","result":"affirmative","slug":"division-federal-senate-9059","source_url":"https://theyvoteforyou.org.au/divisions/senate/2024-08-19/6"}
